      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al final, los dos bandos se sentaron a hablar.",
          "en": "In the end, the two sides sat down to talk."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cansados de destruirse, decidieron hacer las paces.",
          "en": "Tired of destroying one another, they decided to make peace."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para sellar el acuerdo, los dioses se acercaron a una gran vasija.",
          "en": "To seal the agreement, the gods gathered around a great vessel."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y cada uno escupió en ella, como señal de que la paz era verdadera.",
          "en": "And each one spat into it, as a sign that the peace was true."
        },
        {
          "es": "De esa mezcla nacería Kvasir, y de su sangre, la poesía. Por eso la poesía nació de la paz.",
          "en": "From that mixture Kvasir would be born, and from his blood, poetry. That is why poetry was born from peace."
        }
      ],
