      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Para que la paz durara, cada bando entregó rehenes: a los mejores de su gente.",
          "en": "To make the peace last, each side handed over hostages: the best of their people."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los Vanir enviaron a Njord, a su hijo Freyr y a su hija Freyja, que se fueron a vivir a Asgard.",
          "en": "The Vanir sent Njord, his son Freyr and his daughter Freyja, who went to live in Asgard."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los Æsir enviaron a Hœnir, un dios alto y de buena presencia, y a Mímir, el más sabio de todos.",
          "en": "The Æsir sent Hœnir, a tall and handsome god, and Mímir, the wisest of them all."
        },
        {
          "es": "Njord, Freyr y Freyja fueron recibidos con honores, y Freyja enseñó a los Æsir su antigua magia.",
          "en": "Njord, Freyr and Freyja were received with honor, and Freyja taught the Æsir her ancient magic."
        },
        {
          "es": "Parecía que la guerra había terminado para siempre.",
          "en": "It seemed that the war was over for good."
        }
