      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "En Vanaheim, los Vanir hicieron jefe a Hœnir, porque era alto y parecía un gran líder.",
          "en": "In Vanaheim, the Vanir made Hœnir their chief, because he was tall and looked like a great leader."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero cada vez que debía decidir algo, Hœnir miraba a Mímir y esperaba su consejo.",
          "en": "But every time he had to decide something, Hœnir looked to Mímir and waited for his advice."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y cuando Mímir no estaba a su lado, Hœnir respondía: que decidan otros.",
          "en": "And when Mímir was not at his side, Hœnir would answer: let others decide."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces los Vanir se sintieron engañados: los Æsir les habían dado un jefe que no pensaba por sí mismo.",
          "en": "Then the Vanir felt cheated: the Æsir had given them a chief who could not think for himself."
        },
        {
          "es": "Furiosos, tomaron a Mímir y le cortaron la cabeza.",
          "en": "Furious, they seized Mímir and cut off his head."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y le enviaron la cabeza a Odín, como respuesta.",
          "en": "And they sent the head to Odin, as their answer."
        }
      ],
